 As players progress, they advance through phases from basic survival to leading a guild, eventually participating in faction warfare between House Atreides and House Harkonnen. The game features both PvE and PvP zones, with a Deep Desert area that reshapes weekly through Coriolis storms.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dune-awakening", "videos": [{"id": 73639, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "anZtoPo2Fpw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=anZtoPo2Fpw", "title": "Dune: Awakening \u2013 Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/anZtoPo2Fpw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 109083, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Ixq-y_r-lkE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ixq-y_r-lkE", "title": "Dune: Awakening \u2013 Pre-Alpha Teaser Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ixq-y_r-lkE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 109084, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "LW6ou6mugAA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LW6ou6mugAA", "title": "Dune: Awakening \u2013 Creating Worlds, from Book to Film to Game", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LW6ou6mugAA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 109085, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "cR9qiRGxaN4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cR9qiRGxaN4", "title": "Dune: Awakening Direct \u2013 Episode 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cR9qiRGxaN4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 123404, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "1S-l7NySFsI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1S-l7NySFsI", "title": "Dune: Awakening \u2013 Survive Arrakis Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1S-l7NySFsI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 123405, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "smLziWRO9GU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=smLziWRO9GU", "title": "Dune: Awakening \u2013 Story Cinematic (The Vision of Paul Atreides)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/smLziWRO9GU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 123406, "name": "Gameplay 